Z||000014||qwikgta||06-10-2001||12:40 AM||||Tina,  I hear ya.  I waited 3 weeks to get them, every time I emailed them they said they were on the way.  They shipped them in a box that was the size of a shoebox with no paper or wrapping of any kind.  They had bounced around and were chipped up.  There were no directions or bolts or anything.  Then I noticed that they were not even the same size as each other.  One was about a 1/2 taller than the other, the shorter one was about a 1/2 longer than the other.  And neather sat straight on the table.  They have two big holes on the bottom and two little holes on the top.  No holes line up with any holes on the stock wing or the stock mounting "stud" holes on the deck.  To top it off, I paid $58.00 for them and they will not give me a refund.<P>-- Sorry had to vent--<P>Rob<P>------------------<BR>qwikgta@yahoo.com<BR>88 T-Top coupe, 65K, Header no Cat, 16" GTZ rims, short shifter, swaybar, open element air cleaner, hood vents.<BR>http://robsfieroproject.homestead.com/index.html<BR>http://vafiero.com||||reg||1
