Z||000017||Monkeyman||06-10-2001||12:17 PM||||5 feet seems to be fairly popular these days. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Stock height, 4 1/2" and 7" seems to be the ones out there now.  Something in one piece (no additions/extentions, please) with good quality that would be a direct replacement (holes already drilled, ready for paint, etc) would work fine.  I think something a little more reasonable in price would get you more business than you could handle. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
